  "description": "Create warm and festive holiday artwork with Christmas Baking & Cookies Vol.3, a premium collection of 15 PNG clipart designs centered around gingerbread treats and Christmas bakery themes. This volume features charming gingerbread houses, decorated gingerbread men, cookie arrangements, festive cupcakes, hot cocoa, candy canes, cookie baskets, baking boxes and cozy holiday dessert compositions. Detailed icing patterns, colorful candies, peppermint decorations, cinnamon sticks and evergreen foliage bring each illustration to life with a nostalgic Christmas feel. The artwork uses a sophisticated watercolor style with handcrafted textures, soft highlights and natural shadows, making each element look warm, delicious and beautifully illustrated. Traditional red, green, cream and gingerbread brown tones maintain a consistent seasonal aesthetic across the collection. Every design is supplied as a high-resolution PNG with a transparent background, giving you flexibility for layering and composition. Files are prepared at 300 DPI, making them suitable for printing and digital creative projects. Perfect for Christmas sublimation, stickers, invitations, greeting cards, apparel designs, scrapbook pages, printable products and holiday crafts. Includes 15 premium PNG clipart designs. Mockup Not Included.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create warm and festive holiday artwork with Christmas Baking &amp; Cookies Vol.3, a premium collection of 15 PNG clipart designs centered around gingerbread treats and Christmas bakery themes. This volume features charming gingerbread houses, decorated gingerbread men, cookie arrangements, festive cupcakes, hot cocoa, candy canes, cookie baskets, baking boxes and cozy holiday dessert compositions. Detailed icing patterns, colorful candies, peppermint decorations, cinnamon sticks and evergreen foliage bring each illustration to life with a nostalgic Christmas feel. The artwork uses a sophisticated watercolor style with handcrafted textures, soft highlights and natural shadows, making each element look warm, delicious and beautifully illustrated. Traditional red, green, cream and gingerbread brown tones maintain a consistent seasonal aesthetic across the collection. Every design is supplied as a high-resolution PNG with a transparent background, giving you flexibility for layering and composition. Files are prepared at 300 DPI, making them suitable for printing and digital creative projects. Perfect for Christmas sublimation, stickers, invitations, greeting cards, apparel designs, scrapbook pages, printable products and holiday crafts. Includes 15 premium PNG clipart designs. Mockup Not Included.</p>",
